#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/5-ht.md:7 498684927ce44fc9a7c0bc8c58df392c
msgid ""
"**Plugin:** `ht_ros2_control/PantheraHardwareInterface`. `config_file` is"
" required in `on_init`. Description xacro chooses `Panthera.yaml` vs "
"`PantheraDual.yaml`; there is no `dual_config_file` hardware_parameter in"
" source (README names that as the xacro selector). Motor YAML in "
"`external/motor_cpp/robot_param/` (`Panthera.yaml` / "
"`PantheraDual.yaml`). Default devices `/dev/ttyACM*`."
msgstr ""
"**插件：** `ht_ros2_control/PantheraHardwareInterface`。`on_init` 要求 "
"`config_file`。描述 xacro 选择 `Panthera.yaml` 或 `PantheraDual.yaml`；源码中没有 "
"`dual_config_file` hardware_parameter（README 把它当作 xacro 选择器）。电机 YAML 在 "
"`external/motor_cpp/robot_param/`（`Panthera.yaml` / "
"`PantheraDual.yaml`）。默认设备 `/dev/ttyACM*`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/5-ht.md:9 288283c903d148cc8def8b896d6b2142
msgid ""
"Features from that README: isomorphic master–slave teleop path on the "
"description launch; gravity compensation via `ht_gravity_compensation` "
"when kp/kd are not command interfaces. Field how-to: [HighTorque Panthera"
" HT](../../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md)."
msgstr ""
"该 README 中的能力：描述 launch 上的同构主从遥操作路径；当 kp/kd 不是命令接口时，用 "
"`ht_gravity_compensation` 做重力补偿。现场操作：[HighTorque Panthera "
"HT](../../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/5-ht.md:11
#: 02b561e5b7f8464e80d2b9a86dbfa132
msgid ""
"`joint_kp` / `joint_kd` / `gripper_kp` / `gripper_kd` are exposed as node"
" parameters. README: IO thread syncs about every 200 ms — `ros2 param "
"set` / rqt takes effect without reload. No `on_set_parameters` callback; "
"the poll is the Runtime path."
msgstr ""
"`joint_kp` / `joint_kd` / `gripper_kp` / `gripper_kd` 作为节点参数暴露。README：IO "
"线程大约每 200 ms 同步一次 — `ros2 param set` / rqt 无需重载即可生效。没有 "
"`on_set_parameters` 回调；轮询就是运行时路径。"

